{"est_no":"167-31467","est_id":"8735","name":"Edwin Lee Elementary School","est_type":"School","address":"1201 Bunn Ave","city":"Springfield","state":"IL","zip":"62703","visits":[{"id":"742961","date":"2026-05-08","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8735&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=742961&INSPECTION_NN=742961","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":16,"title":"Food-contact surfaces; cleaned and sanitized.","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"4-501.114(A)","citation_text":"4-501.114(A) Manual and Mechanical Warewashing Equipment, Chemical Sanitization - Temperature, pH, Concentration, and Hardness. A chemical SANITIZER used in a SANITIZING solution for a manual or mechanical operation at contact times specified under 4-703.11(C) shall meet the criteria specified under §7-204.11.\n\nOn arrival the quat based sanitizer in the three part sink was observed low on the inspector’s test strips. Per employees the dish machine is not used on Fridays (today) meaning that the three part sink is the only dish cleaning method being utilized today. The PIC stated that it was about time to change out the water anyway and did so during this inspection to correct the violation. Ensure that all sanitizers are maintained at effective concentrations at all times."}]},{"id":"606483","date":"2026-01-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8735&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=606483&INSPECTION_NN=606483","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"543850","date":"2025-04-29","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8735&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=543850&INSPECTION_NN=543850","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":8,"title":"Hands clean and properly washed.","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"2-301.12(C)","citation_text":"2-301.12(C) Cleaning Procedure. (C) To avoid recontaminating their hands or surrogate prosthetic devices, FOOD EMPLOYEES may use disposable paper towels or similar clean barriers when touching surfaces such as manually operated faucet handles on a HANDWASHING SINK or the handle of a restroom door.\n\nAn employee was observed to use their bare hand to turn off the faucet after hand washing. Education was conducted and should be passed on to employees and staff. Ensure that proper hand washing is taking place at all times."}]},{"id":"531712","date":"2025-01-29","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8735&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=531712&INSPECTION_NN=531712","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"501412","date":"2024-05-10","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8735&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=501412&INSPECTION_NN=501412","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"488006","date":"2024-01-25","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8735&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=488006&INSPECTION_NN=488006","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"454493","date":"2023-04-25","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://publi